        "description": "<p class=\"feature\">Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d8 + 1) Acid damage. Nonmagical armor worn by the target takes a −1 penalty to the AC it offers. The armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10. The penalty can be removed by casting the <em>Mending</em> spell on the armor.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-RpEIbnL6lqJ2F9gS\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature provides an <strong>AC Penalty</strong> enchantment that will modify a targeted armor. Since this penalty can be applied multiple times, this enchantment needs to be dragged from this item's Effect tab onto the target armor item.</p></section>",
